      "scenario": "Because the agent is asked to fix bugs and explains its work fluently, reviewers skim the branch and approve. An injected or hallucinated change buried in a large diff (an auth check removed, a dependency swapped for a typosquat, a URL repointed) reaches the default branch under normal review, with the agent's own summary providing false assurance.",
